Claude outputs/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately COMMITTED, despite being generated
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/*.csv          - the recorded datasets (~10 MB)
# models/*.pkl        - the trained models (~1 MB)
# models/*.png, *.txt - confusion matrices and training reports
#
# A general-purpose project would ignore all of these as build artifacts. This
# one is coursework: the datasets ARE the contribution, the reports are the
# evidence, and anyone cloning it should be able to run the system straight
# away instead of re-recording 8,000 hand samples first. Total is about 11 MB,
# which is nothing to GitHub (the per-file limit is 100 MB).
#
# To exclude them instead, uncomment:
# data/*.csv
# models/*.pkl
# models/*.png
# models/*.txt

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party model bundle
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7.8 MB, not ours, and `python scripts/download_model.py` fetches it in one
# step. Comment this line out if you would rather a clone need no downloads.
assets/hand_landmarker.task
